  "description": "The girl, the cult, and the pastor. Who's evil?\n\nWoongjae, a pastor who loves splashing cash on designer clothes more than reading the Bible, takes on an investigation to expose a cult in return for a hefty sum. But as he gets deeper into the case, Woongjae is faced with horrors that leave him questioning the faith that he had already lost once.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
